a successful save, the character catches the wheel. 
On a failed save, the wheel hits the deck with a loud 
thud that catches the attention of the zombies in 
area C4. A moment later, the thud is answered by 
a loud crash against the door to C4, which repeats 
every 10 to  1 5  seconds. 
C4 :  CAPTA I N 'S  QUARTERS 
The door to the captain's quarters is barricaded 
from the inside, though the heavy wooden bar block­
