tend with the zombie. Unlike the zombies, the ghoul 
is not a former member of the ship's crew, but a vile 
scavenger drawn by the presence of decaying flesh. 
The water on the floor ranges from about 6 inches 
deep on the starboard (south) side of the ship to 
1 8  inches deep on the port (north) side. The water 
makes the entire lower deck difÏcult terrain (see 
