While charmed  by the harpy, a target is incapacitated and 
ignores the songs of other harpies. If the charmed target is 
more than 5 feet away from the harpy, the target must move on 
its turn toward the harpy by the most d i rect route, trying to get 
with in 5 feet.  It doesn't avoid opportun ity attacks, but before 
moving into damaging terrain, such as lava or a  pit,  and when­
ever it takes damage from a source other than the harpy, the 
target can repeat the savin g  th row. A charmed target can also 
repeat the savi n g  throw at the end of each of its turns. If the 
savin g  throw is successfu l ,  the effect ends on it. 
A target that succeeds on its saving th row is i m m u n e  to this 
h arpy's song for the next 24 hours. 
